</div>


<div class=""slider-group"">

  <div class=""slider-header"">
    <label>自费咨询取消 / 爽约率</label>
    <span class=""value"" id=""privateCancelValue"">10%</span>
  </div>

  <input
    type=""range""
    id=""privateCancel""
    min=""0""
    max=""30""
    value=""10""
  >

</div>


<div class=""slider-group"">

  <div class=""slider-header"">
    <label>取消 / 爽约收费</label>
    <span class=""value"" id=""cancelFeeValue"">$50</span>
  </div>

  <input
    type=""range""
    id=""cancelFee""
    min=""0""
    max=""200""
    step=""5""
    value=""50""
  >

</div>


<div class=""result-box"">

  <div class=""result-title"">
    保险咨询预计月收入
  </div>

  <div class=""main-number"" id=""insuranceMonthly"">
    $8,280
  </div>


  <div class=""result-title secondary-title"">
    自费咨询预计月收入
  </div>

  <div class=""secondary-number"" id=""privateMonthly"">
    $14,700
  </div>


  <div class=""comparison"">

    <div class=""comparison-title"">
      月收入差异
    </div>

    <div class=""difference"" id=""differenceOutput"">
      $6,420
    </div>

    <div class=""comparison-text"" id=""comparisonText"">
      在当前假设下，自费咨询的预计月收入更高。
    </div>

  </div>

</div>


<div class=""annual-box"">

  <div class=""annual-item"">

    <span>保险咨询预计年收入</span>

    <strong id=""insuranceAnnual"">
      $99,360
    </strong>

  </div>


  <div class=""annual-item"">

    <span>自费咨询预计年收入</span>

    <strong id=""privateAnnual"">
      $176,400
    </strong>

  </div>

</div>


<div class=""note"">

结果仅供规划参考。实际保险报销金额会因保险公司、合同费率、服务代码、来访者福利、理赔情况及其他因素而有所不同。本工具不构成财务、税务或保险建议。

